    "title": "CASA asks for volunteers to Advocate for children in Foster Homes - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Bruce Kropp ,\n5 hours ago CASA, Court Appointed Special Advocates, asks for volunteers to help assist in their mission to advocate for children in foster care. CASA member, Tavan Hiestand, Program Director over Clay, Marion, and Clinton counties, asks for community volunteers to help with CASA. Assisting her was volunteer and outreach coordinator, Zoey Bridges. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
